/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!untagged(foo)` construct.
 *
 * The name of a tagged function means the instance its tags were merged into.
 * This pragma reaches the function as written instead.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::untagged
